# h2mare environment configuration
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your values.
# .env is gitignored and must never be committed.

# ── Paths ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# The h2mare project root. Everything BASE_DIR-relative hangs off it: data/
# (raw downloads, interim, processed zarr/parquet/metadata) and logs/, plus the
# config.yaml and .env that are read from it by default. Note this is separate
# from STORE_ROOT below, which is only where the per-variable Zarr stores live.
#
# Overrides the default auto-detection, which walks up from the current working
# directory looking for a config.yaml. Set it to run h2mare from an unrelated
# directory, to keep the data tree outside the repo, or when another project
# imports h2mare as a library. Unlike the auto-detection, the path is taken as
# given — no config.yaml has to exist there.
#
# Only works as a real environment variable: the root is resolved *before* .env
# is loaded (and .env is looked for under that root), so setting it in this file
# cannot influence the search that finds this file.
# H2MARE_ROOT=/path/to/project/root

# Directory where downloaded datasets are stored.
# Must be an absolute path to a location with sufficient disk space.
# This is the root for variables that do not name one themselves; a variable
# can override it with `store_root:` in config.yaml to sit on another drive.
STORE_ROOT=/path/to/your/data/store

# ── CMEMS (Copernicus Marine Service) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Register at https://data.marine.copernicus.eu/register
# Then run: copernicusmarine login
#
# No env var to set: the copernicusmarine CLI stores the credentials itself and
# h2mare reads none. (CMEMS_USERNAME / CMEMS_PASSWORD used to be listed here;
# nothing ever consulted them, so setting them did nothing.)

# ── AVISO (Archiving, Validation and Interpretation of Satellite Oceanographic data) ──
# Register at https://www.aviso.altimetry.fr/en/data/data-access/registration-form.html
AVISO_USERNAME=your_aviso_email
AVISO_PASSWORD=your_aviso_password
AVISO_FTP_SERVER=ftp-access.aviso.altimetry.fr
